<Slide style={{ padding: 60, background: '#0F172A' }}>
  <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12, marginBottom: 22 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 6, height: 28, background: '#6366F1', borderRadius: 3 }} />
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F1F5F9' }}>三层解法（总纲）</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 1, background: '#334155', marginBottom: 24 }} />
  <Box style={{ gap: 18 }}>
    {[
      { n: '01', t: '把权限做成结构', d: 'P0–P3 分级，高危动作智能体永久无权' },
      { n: '02', t: '把确认做成数学', d: 'HMAC 参数指纹，改一个字符就失效' },
      { n: '03', t: '把攻击做成回归', d: '70 条攻击 + 25 条误伤对照，每次合并必须全绿' },
    ].map((it, i) => (
      <Box key={i} style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 24, background: '#1E293B', border: '1px solid #334155', borderRadius: 12, padding: '22px 26px' }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 56, height: 56, borderRadius: 14, background: '#6366F1', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>{it.n}</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F1F5F9', marginBottom: 6 }}>{it.t}</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#CBD5E1', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>{it.d}</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
    ))}
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ background: '#1E293B', borderLeft: '4px solid #6366F1', borderRadius: 8, padding: '18px 24px', marginTop: 24 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#CBD5E1', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
      注意第三层的「25」：误伤和漏拦一样是事故——把「你们风控规则是什么」也拦掉，产品就废了。
    </Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', bottom: 26, left: 60 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#475569' }}>AgentBank · 智能体银行</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', bottom: 26, right: 60 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#475569' }}>04 / 18</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
